<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgystan June inflation slows to 0.7 pct vs May.</title>
<headline>Kyrgystan June inflation slows to 0.7 pct vs May.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan's June consumer price inflation slowed to 0.7 percent from May's 2.7 percent, a report from the National Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    KYRGYZ CONSUMER PRICES    June '97     May '97     June '96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month pct change    +0.7	  +2.7	   +1.0</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change     +29.2	 +29.8	  +32.5</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
